# Agent OS

This project uses Agent OS for structured AI workflows.

## Standards

Project standards live in `agent-os/standards/`. The index is at `agent-os/standards/index.yml`.

Always read relevant standards before implementing features. Use `/agent-os/inject-standards` to identify which apply.

## Commands

These slash commands are available under `.cursor/commands/agent-os/`:

| Command | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `/agent-os/discover-standards` | Extract tribal knowledge from the codebase into documented standards |
| `/agent-os/index-standards` | Rebuild and maintain `agent-os/standards/index.yml` |
| `/agent-os/inject-standards` | Identify and inject relevant standards into the current task context |
| `/agent-os/plan-product` | Generate `agent-os/product/` docs (mission, roadmap, tech stack) |
| `/agent-os/shape-spec` | Shape a feature and produce a spec in `agent-os/specs/` (run in plan mode) |

## Key Paths

- Standards: `agent-os/standards/`
- Specs: `agent-os/specs/`
- Product docs: `agent-os/product/`
